{"version":1,"content":"<p>韓國5人樂隊N.Flying剛於本月25日完成香港演唱會，隨即宣布12月5日假澳門百老匯舉行《2026 N.Flying Live '&amp;CON5 : into REM'》澳門站演出。</p><p>N.Flying是次巡唱，承繼樂隊標誌性「&amp;CON」系列，副標題「into REM」寓意樂隊帶領粉絲探索潛意識與夢境深處的音樂奇景。</p><p>演唱會票價由888港元起，下月3日透過銀河票務、大麥、Trip.com及Ctrip公開發售。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T10:21:52.833438+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":205,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T09:35:58+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T02:18:18.848003+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T10:18:15.947120+00:00","content_hash":"4f33acc0c0ded24c7bcebb7e11fe2f5d07c4f6847925e011d022da90d836f7c2","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}